      "text": "A choropleth map titled \"EPI: BCG coverage by district - last month\" showing the districts of a single country, coloured by BCG coverage (%) for December 2016. The legend gives five bands with district counts: Low 0-70 (1), Mid 70-80 (3), High 80-90 (5), Highest 90-100 (3) and Invalid 100-1000 (0). Only the southernmost district is in the low band.",
